@startuml Singleton Pattern

class Authenticator {
    - static volatile Authenticator _instance
    - static readonly object _lock
    - Authenticator()
    + static Authenticator GetInstance()
    + void Authenticate(string username, string password)
}

class Program {
    + static void Main(string[] args)
}

Program --> Authenticator : uses

note right of Authenticator
  Singleton Pattern:
  - Private constructor
  - Static instance
  - Thread-safe
  - Double-checked locking
end note

@enduml 